A British climber of 28 died Thursday after falling about 61 meters on Torres Serrero, the

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.640
highest peak of the Picos de Europa.

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:11.120
The Spanish civil guard in Asturias said so, the Guardian reports, and his body was found

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.780
about 20 meters below the summit.

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:19.560
By 2022, more than a fifth of the flats at Dublin's 125-flat Buckingham Village were under

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:24.480
rental bans, and the complex once made up almost half of Dublin City Council's prohibition

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:26.420
