00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:32.100
On the case on both sides of faster returns from Spain to Morocco, the government is drafting

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.300
a real decreto-lay.

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:34.760
It is not in force.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:40.160
It could send some people who reached Sayuta back to Morocco before ever administrative and

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:41.280
judicial appeal is done.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:47.140
It would cover citizens of countries the European Union lists as safe, Morocco among them, nearly

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:50.900
two months after a mass arrival, as authorities deal with thousands of

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:55.740
arrivals from Sayyuta. Interior Minister Fernando Grande Marlaska has said

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:59.200
people with no right to remain will be returned, and that people seeking

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:03.860
protection go back only after their claims are examined and rejected. The stated

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:08.660
aim is to stop an asylum request from freezing a renewal for months. Territorial

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:14.260
policy minister Anghel Victor Torres has described about 150 to 200 voluntary

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:18.600
returns to Morocco a day, and 160 in one recent day.

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:22.440
Officials are already moving cases and are not waiting on the decree.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:26.940
As the draft is written, the Commission Intermini Stéria de Asilo

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:28.980
could lose its first look at a file.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.980
People turned down might have five days to appeal,

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:33.800
and those files would go first.

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:38.220
The same account says very few asylum applications for Morocco succeed,

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:41.340
yet those applicants would still face a different process

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.780
before the case is fully settled.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:47.920
A separate disputed clause could archive applications if people leave reception centers,

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:52.980
and that could open the way to expulsion, while investigations into suspected ill-treatment

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:54.600
at some facilities stay open.

00:04:55.260 --> 00:05:00.080
The government in that account of the draft both treat the decree as not yet law, and both

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:02.700
record that returns to Morocco are already happening.

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:07.860
The next step is whether the government adopts the real decretole, a sign of progress.

